#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/rtl9617c-cpu.js:422
msgid "\"Dynamic (schedutil, recommended)\" lets the kernel scheduler scale frequency by live load, dropping to 400 MHz when idle to stay cool and ramping to 1200 MHz under full load."
msgstr "「动态调频 (schedutil，推荐)」由内核调度器按实时负载自动升降频，空闲回落至 400 MHz 降温省电，满载瞬时拉升至 1200 MHz。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/rtl9617c-cpu.js:423
msgid "\"Performance (performance)\" locks all cores at 1200 MHz; \"Fixed Frequency (userspace)\" lets you lock a specific hardware OPP."
msgstr "「性能模式 (performance)」全程锁定 1200 MHz 最高频；「固定频率 (userspace)」可手动指定单个硬件频点。"

